---
---

<figure id="esquema-hexagono">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 720 400"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="hex-title hex-desc"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  >
    <title id="hex-title">Esquema del hexágono</title>
    <desc id="hex-desc">
      El dominio está en el centro, rodeado por la aplicación. A los lados, los adaptadores (React y
      localStorage) se conectan a la aplicación a través de puertos. Las flechas apuntan hacia dentro.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker id="flecha" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Aplicación -->
    <polygon points="510,200 435,330 285,330 210,200 285,70 435,70" fill="var(--app)" fill-opacity=".15" stroke="var(--app)" stroke-width="3"></polygon>
    <text x="360" y="104" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">Aplicación</text>
    <text x="360" y="318" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">agregarTarea()</text>

    <!-- Dominio -->
    <polygon points="440,200 400,269 320,269 280,200 320,131 400,131" fill="var(--domain)" fill-opacity=".25" stroke="var(--domain)" stroke-width="3"></polygon>
    <text x="360" y="198" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">Dominio</text>
    <text x="360" y="220" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="currentColor">puedeAgregarTarea</text>

    <!-- Puertos -->
    <circle cx="210" cy="200" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3"></circle>
    <circle cx="510" cy="200" r="9" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3"></circle>
    <text x="204" y="236" text-anchor="end" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">Puerto</text>
    <text x="516" y="236" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">Puerto</text>

    <!-- Adaptadores -->
    <rect x="10" y="160" width="140" height="80" rx="8" fill="var(--adapter)" fill-opacity=".15" stroke="var(--adapter)" stroke-width="3"></rect>
    <text x="80" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">React</text>
    <text x="80" y="217" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">ListaTareas</text>

    <rect x="570" y="160" width="140" height="80" rx="8" fill="var(--adapter)" fill-opacity=".15" stroke="var(--adapter)" stroke-width="3"></rect>
    <text x="640" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" font-size="16" fill="currentColor">localStorage</text>
    <text x="640" y="217" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">o una API</text>

    <!-- Flechas hacia dentro -->
    <line x1="150" y1="200" x2="199" y2="200" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#flecha)"></line>
    <line x1="570" y1="200" x2="521" y2="200" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#flecha)"></line>

    <!-- Rótulos -->
    <text x="80" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">Adaptador de entrada</text>
    <text x="640" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">Adaptador de salida</text>

    <!-- Recorrido -->
    <g font-weight="700" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle">
      <circle cx="175" cy="180" r="11" fill="var(--accent)"></circle><text x="175" y="185" fill="#fff">1</text>
      <circle cx="360" cy="290" r="11" fill="var(--accent)"></circle><text x="360" y="295" fill="#fff">2</text>
      <circle cx="334" cy="160" r="11" fill="var(--accent)"></circle><text x="334" y="165" fill="#fff">3</text>
      <circle cx="545" cy="180" r="11" fill="var(--accent)"></circle><text x="545" y="185" fill="#fff">4</text>
      <circle cx="640" cy="265" r="11" fill="var(--accent)"></circle><text x="640" y="270" fill="#fff">5</text>
    </g>

    <text x="360" y="380" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" fill="currentColor">Las flechas apuntan siempre hacia dentro</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Qué pasa cuando el usuario pulsa "Agregar":</strong>
    <ol>
      <li>React recibe el clic y llama al caso de uso.</li>
      <li><code>agregarTarea</code> pide las tareas actuales a través del puerto.</li>
      <li>El dominio decide si se puede agregar (no vacía, menos de 5).</li>
      <li>Si se puede, el caso de uso pide guardar a través del puerto.</li>
      <li>El adaptador guarda de verdad (<code>localStorage</code> o API).</li>
    </ol>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  figure {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    scroll-margin-top: 8rem;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
